message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "Open Car Dynamics"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Open Car Dynamics provides a comprehensive, modular, and highly efficient
  implementation of a vehicle's dynamic behaviour. Following the philosophy of modelling
  vehicle behaviour in as much detail as necessary, but as simply as possible, the
  library simplifies parametrisation and adaptation to custom requirements. It is written
  in modern C++ for maximum performance and provides integrations for Python and ROS 2.
  The vehicle dynamics have been validated against data recorded with the AV21 autonomous
  racecar used in the Indy Autonomous Challenge.
